  "fullContentHtml": "\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">Railway RRB ALP Recruitment 2026</h1>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-11T10:13:22+05:30\">June 11, 2026</time></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">10:13 am</span>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><a href=\"https://indianrailways.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Railway Recruitment Board (RRB)</strong></a> has released a <strong>notification</strong> on <strong>its official website</strong> for the recruitment of <strong>Assistant Loco Pilot (ALP) posts.</strong> This recruitment is being conducted <strong>for 11,127 vacancies.</strong> The RRB application process <strong>has started on 15 May 2026,</strong> and candidates can <strong>apply until 14 June 2026.</strong> The minimum <strong>age limit is 18 years,</strong> while the maximum age limit is <strong>30 years as on 01 July 2026.</strong> Candidates are <strong>advised to check the complete details</strong> for the <strong>Railway RRB ALP Recruitment 2026</strong> provided below.&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>(CEN – 01/2026)</strong></span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Telegram </a></div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">Railway RRB ALP Online Form 2026 (11,127 Posts)</h2>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">Railway RRB ALP Examination 2026 : Short Details</h3>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/rrb-alp-2026/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Official Notification : <strong>13 May&nbsp;2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Start Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>15 May 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Last Date : <strong>14 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Last Date For Fee Payment : <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>16 June 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Correction Date : 17 – 26 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>Notify Later</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>04 Days Before Exam</b></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Result Date : <strong>Will Be Updated Here Soon</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates are advised to confirm from the <strong>RRB ALP</strong><b>&nbsp;</b>official website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>General/ OBC Candidates</strong> <strong>: ₹ 500/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>SC/ ST/ PwBD Ex-Serviceman Candidates : ₹ 250/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Fee Refund :</strong>&nbsp;General / OBC :&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 400/-</strong>&nbsp;will be refunded and Other candidates :&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 250/-</strong>&nbsp;will be refunded to the bank account after appearing in Stage I Exam.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode (Online):</strong> You can make the payment using the following methods:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Debit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Credit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internet Banking</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">IMPS</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Cash Card / Mobile Wallet</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">Railway RRB ALP Notification 2026 : Age Limits As On 01 July 2026</h5>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Minimum Age : <strong>18 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>30 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Railway</strong> provides age relaxation for the <strong>Railway RRB ALP </strong>position as per their regulations.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">11,127 Posts</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\">\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\">Railway RRB ALP Recruitment 2026 : Vacancy Details</h6>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 150px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"2\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;Category Wise Vacancy Details&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Category Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>No. Of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">UR</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">4860</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">OBC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">2598</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">EWS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">1004</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">SC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">1746</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">ST</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">919</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 22.0448%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.6903%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 22.0448%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Assistant Loco Pilot (ALP)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.6903%; text-align: center;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have <strong>passed 10th grade</strong> along with an <strong>ITI certificate in the relevant trade</strong> or hold a <strong>Diploma/Degree in Engineering</strong> in the respective field.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"> For Zone-wise eligibility, check the official notification…<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong><a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/CEN-01-2026-Eng-639143539720035538-24.pdf\">Click Here</a></strong></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #800000;\">You May Also Check :</span></strong> <strong><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/indian-coast-guard-navik-gd-yantrik-recruitment-2025/\">Indian Coast Guard Navik GD &amp; Yantrik Recruitment 2025</a></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;How To Fill Railway RRB ALP Online Form 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Interested candidates who wish to apply for the&nbsp;<strong>RRB </strong>post can submit their application online before&nbsp;<strong>14 June 2026.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Use the click here link provided below under important link section to apply directly.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Alternatively, visit the&nbsp;<strong>official website of RRB </strong>to complete the application process online.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Make sure to complete the application before the deadline&nbsp;<a href=\"https://indianrailways.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>14 June</strong><strong>&nbsp;2026.</strong></span></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Note –</strong> छात्रो से ये अनुरोध किया जाता है की इस भर्ती की सभी जानकारी पिछले वर्ष की भर्ती के अनुसार दी गयी है अतः छात्रों से अनुरोध है की वो अपना फॉर्म भरने से पहले Official Notification को ध्यान से जरूर पढे उसके बाद ही अपना फॉर्म भरे । (<strong>Last Date, Age Limit, &amp; Education Qualification</strong>)</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;Railway RRC ALP Recruitment 2026 : </span>Mode Of Selection&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>CBT 1 (Computer-Based Test )</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>CBT 2 (Computer-Based Test )</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>CBAT (Computer-Based Aptitude Test)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Document Verification &amp; Medical Examination</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\">Join Our WhatsApp Channel</span></strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow Now</a></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\">Join Our Telegram Channel</span></strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: cen